{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "inbox-batch-cleanup",
  "scope": "system",
  "title": "Inbox Batch Cleanup",
  "description": "Loop 每轮用工具加载 batch-count 条 JSON inbox note 及展示投影作为 ResourceBundle，Pi/LLM 用稳定 note_id 做语义判断，系统按本轮 node_outputs 精确执行，避免 Windows 长命令行。",
  "version": 15,
  "readonly": true,
  "metadata": {
    "tags": [
      "resource-bundle",
      "pi",
      "llm-assisted",
      "inbox",
      "ticket"
    ],
    "related_tickets": [],
    "owner": "blackboard",
    "run_policy": {
      "allow_concurrent_runs": false,
      "max_concurrent_runs": 1,
      "queue_enabled": true,
      "max_queue_wait_ms": 1800000,
      "queue_timeout_retry_enabled": false,
      "max_queue_timeout_retries": 5
    }
  },
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "batch-count",
      "label": "一次处理几条",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 5,
      "description": "每轮最多让 LLM 决策并由系统工具沉淀删除的 inbox note 数量。",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "max-iterations",
      "label": "循环次数",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 5,
      "description": "Loop 最多执行多少轮。",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 50
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "label": "Start",
      "position": {
        "x": -736,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {},
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cleanup-loop",
      "type": "loop",
      "label": "Inbox Cleanup Loop",
      "description": "每轮先构造 ResourceBundle，再让 LLM 决策，最后系统工具执行。",
      "position": {
        "x": -427.6538453640005,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "body_entry": "collect-resource-bundle",
        "body_exit": "apply-output-validate",
        "condition": {
          "input_ref": "$.nodes.apply-output-validate.output",
          "op": "equals",
          "path": "$.data.continue",
          "value": true
        },
        "max_iterations": 3,
        "max_iterations_ref": "{{inputs.max-iterations}}",
        "on_max_iterations": "succeed"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "body",
          "label": "Body",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "exit",
          "label": "Exit",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "index",
          "label": "Index",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "int",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-resource-bundle",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Collect Inbox ResourceBundle",
      "description": "薄工具：只按 batch-count 读取当前 inbox 前 N 条 JSON note 的 path/name/document/content，并附 active ticket catalog；不做归因判断。",
      "position": {
        "x": -80,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/collect_inbox_resource_bundle.py",
          "--project",
          "{{env.project}}",
          "--repo-root",
          "{{env.root}}/..",
          "--batch-count",
          "{{inputs.batch-count}}"
        ],
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        },
        "command": "python3",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "permission": "read_only",
        "timeout_ms": 120000
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "ResourceBundle",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm-decide-cleanup",
      "type": "llm",
      "label": "LLM Decide Cleanup",
      "description": "Pi LLM 节点：只基于本轮 ResourceBundle 中的 JSON note document/content 与 active ticket catalog 做语义判断，输出 decisions。",
      "position": {
        "x": 224,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "agent": "native",
        "inputs": {
          "resource_bundle": "{{nodes.collect-resource-bundle.output.stdout_json}}"
        },
        "model": "minimax-cn/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed",
        "output": {
          "artifact_type": "json",
          "required": true
        },
        "prompt": {
          "mode": "inline",
          "template": "你是 Blackboard inbox cleanup 的 Pi LLM 节点。\n\n系统已经用工具为你加载了本轮需要处理的 ResourceBundle。注意：ResourceBundle 不是摘要提示词，而是本轮真实资源输入。\n它包含：\n- inbox.note_count：当前 inbox 总数\n- inbox.notes：本轮按 batch-count 取出的 JSON note，每条有稳定 id、path、name、absolute_path、document、content\n- tickets.active_tickets：当前可写入的 active tickets catalog\n\nResourceBundle JSON:\n{{inputs.resource_bundle}}\n\n你的职责：\n1. 只处理 ResourceBundle.data_sources.inbox.notes 里列出的这些 note，不要假设还有别的 note。\n2. decisions 必须引用 note.id，例如 note_1；不要自己复制中文文件名作为主键。\n3. 根据 JSON document、展示投影、文件名、路径、ticket 标题/summary/feature/component 语义判断目标 active ticket。\n4. 文件名或 document 里的 078 / 000078 这类 token 是强置信信号，但如果 document/content 明显冲突，则 retain。\n5. 只能输出 high-confidence decisions；不确定就放 retained。\n6. 不直接写文件，不调用 shell，不删除 note。系统后续节点会根据你的 JSON 和 ResourceBundle 执行。\n7. 只输出 JSON 对象，不要 Markdown，不要解释。\n\n输出 schema:\n{\n  \"processed\": true,\n  \"decisions\": [\n    {\"note_id\": \"note_1\", \"ticket_id\": \"000078\", \"confidence\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"为什么这条 note 明确属于该 ticket\"}\n  ],\n  \"retained\": [\n    {\"note_id\": \"note_2\", \"reason\": \"为什么本轮不能高置信处理\"}\n  ],\n  \"continue\": true\n}\n\n如果本轮 notes 里没有任何可高置信处理项，输出 processed=false, decisions=[], continue=false。"
        },
        "retry": {
          "backoff_ms": 1000,
          "enabled": true,
          "max_attempts": 3
        },
        "run_as": "llm",
        "runtime": "pi",
        "tool_policy": {
          "allowed_tools": []
        },
        "resource_bundle": {
          "input": "resource_bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        "output_contract": {
          "artifact_type": "json",
          "required": true
        }
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "resource_bundle",
          "label": "Resource Bundle",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "Decision",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "normalize-decision",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Normalize Decision Shape",
      "description": "薄工具：只修复 LLM 输出的 JSON 外形；完整决策原样通过，单个 retained item 只包装成 retained，不做语义归因。",
      "position": {
        "x": 512,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/normalize_inbox_cleanup_decision.py",
          "--decision-json",
          "{{nodes.llm-decide-cleanup.output}}"
        ],
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        },
        "command": "python3",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "permission": "read_only",
        "timeout_ms": 120000
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "Normalized Decision",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-output-validate",
      "type": "schema_validate",
      "label": "Decision Validate",
      "description": "校验 LLM 决策 contract，确保系统执行节点只接收结构化决策。",
      "position": {
        "x": 807.0823813023004,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "fail_on_invalid": true,
        "inputs": {
          "value": "{{nodes.normalize-decision.output.stdout_json}}"
        },
        "schema": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "continue": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "decisions": {
              "items": {
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "confidence": {
                    "enum": [
                      "high"
                    ],
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "note_id": {
                    "pattern": "^note_[0-9]+$",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "ticket_id": {
                    "pattern": "^[0-9]{6}$",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "note_id",
                  "ticket_id",
                  "confidence",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "type": "object"
              },
              "maxItems": 20,
              "type": "array"
            },
            "processed": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "retained": {
              "items": {
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "note_id": {
                    "pattern": "^note_[0-9]+$",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "note_id",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "type": "object"
              },
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "processed",
            "decisions",
            "retained",
            "continue"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        "schema_name": "inbox_cleanup_decision"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "Validated Decision",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "apply-decisions",
      "type": "shell",
      "label": "Apply Cleanup Decisions",
      "description": "系统工具执行 LLM 决策：从本轮 node_outputs 读取 decision/resource bundle，append progress_record，删除已沉淀 note，重建 index 并校验。",
      "position": {
        "x": 1100.2098130153472,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "args": [
          "{{env.scripts_dir}}/apply_inbox_cleanup_decisions.py",
          "--project",
          "{{env.project}}",
          "--repo-root",
          "{{env.root}}/..",
          "--batch-count",
          "{{inputs.batch-count}}",
          "--decisions-node-output",
          "decision-output-validate",
          "--resource-bundle-node-output",
          "collect-resource-bundle"
        ],
        "capture": {
          "max_bytes": 1048576,
          "strip_ansi": true
        },
        "command": "python3",
        "expected_exit_codes": [
          0
        ],
        "permission": "project_write",
        "timeout_ms": 300000
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "Apply Result",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "apply-output-validate",
      "type": "schema_validate",
      "label": "Apply Output Validate",
      "description": "校验系统执行结果，loop 只读取这里的 continue。",
      "position": {
        "x": 1395.6617964008822,
        "y": 40
      },
      "config": {
        "fail_on_invalid": true,
        "inputs": {
          "value": "{{nodes.apply-decisions.output.stdout_json}}"
        },
        "schema": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "continue": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "deleted": {
              "items": {
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "processed": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "rejected": {
              "type": "array"
            },
            "remaining_note_count": {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "retained": {
              "type": "array"
            },
            "tickets_updated": {
              "items": {
                "pattern": "^[0-9]{6}$",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "verification": {
              "items": {
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "processed",
            "deleted",
            "retained",
            "rejected",
            "tickets_updated",
            "remaining_note_count",
            "continue",
            "verification"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        "schema_name": "inbox_cleanup_apply_output"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "label": "Validated Apply Result",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "end-success",
      "type": "end",
      "label": "Success",
      "position": {
        "x": -80,
        "y": 224
      },
      "config": {
        "result": "succeeded"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "edge-start-loop",
      "from": "start",
      "to": "cleanup-loop",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-loop-bundle",
      "from": "cleanup-loop",
      "to": "collect-resource-bundle",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "body",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-bundle-llm",
      "from": "collect-resource-bundle",
      "to": "llm-decide-cleanup",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-bundle-llm-data",
      "from": "collect-resource-bundle",
      "to": "llm-decide-cleanup",
      "kind": "data",
      "from_pin": "output",
      "to_pin": "resource_bundle"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-llm-normalize",
      "from": "llm-decide-cleanup",
      "to": "normalize-decision",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-normalize-validate",
      "from": "normalize-decision",
      "to": "decision-output-validate",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-validate-apply",
      "from": "decision-output-validate",
      "to": "apply-decisions",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-apply-validate",
      "from": "apply-decisions",
      "to": "apply-output-validate",
      "kind": "exec",
      "from_pin": "exec_out",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    },
    {
      "id": "edge-loop-end",
      "from": "cleanup-loop",
      "to": "end-success",
      "kind": "exec",
      "label": "Completed",
      "from_pin": "exit",
      "to_pin": "exec_in"
    }
  ],
  "layout": {
    "viewport": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "scale": 1
    }
  }
}
